    "tier": 2,
    "description": "<p>A wary Cascadian route defender who uses cover, a recurved bow, and subtle Resonance with nearby wildlife to pressure intruders while leaving room for withdrawal or conversation.</p><section class=\"cybermancy-fast-play\"><h3>FAST PLAY</h3><p><strong><em>Opening:</em></strong> Open from cover and demand that intruders stop or turn back.</p><p><strong><em>Pressure:</em></strong> Press advancing targets with the Recurved Bow and use Press the Shot when one breaks cover.</p><p><strong><em>Wildlife:</em></strong> Use Resonant Wildlife against a pursuer or someone threatening the hunter’s position.</p><p><strong><em>Off-Ramp:</em></strong> Permit withdrawal or conversation when the intruders stop pressing the route.</p><p><strong><em>Goal:</em></strong> Create a tense, mobile encounter where violence is not inevitable.</p></section>",
